      },
      "message": "Reduce pseudocode for GPR pair instructions. Add rs1_p/rs2_p/rd_p==0 checks\n\nMany of the GPR pair instructions had their pseudocode written as\nto separate blocks of code for the even register and the odd register.\n\nRewrite them to concatenate their sources, loop over the elements\nin both registers, and then write out their results to two registers.\nAdd the rs1_p/rs2_p checks for the source data and a rd_p check for\nthe writes.\n\nThis is an alternative to #239.\n\nRewrite was done with AI. I did a review myself and fixed some\nissues, but I might have missed some.",
